{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03971","headline":"奉和幸韦嗣立山庄侍宴应制 · 刘宪","name":"奉和幸韦嗣立山庄侍宴应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东山有谢安，枉道降鸣銮。\n缇骑分初日，霓旌度晓寒。\n云跸岩间下，虹桥涧底盘。\n幽栖俄以届，圣瞩宛余欢。\n崖悬飞溜直，岸转绿潭宽。\n桂华尧酒泛，松响舜琴弹。\n明主恩斯极，贤臣节更殚。\n不才叨侍从，咏德以濡翰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘宪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03971.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03971","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}